<title>NEW ZEALAND: CITIBANK RAISES NZ FLOATING RATE TO 10.4 PCT.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK RAISES NZ FLOATING RATE TO 10.4 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand unit of Citibank said on Friday it had raised its floating mortgage rate to 10.4 percent from 8.95 percent, effective immediately for all new customers and from August 12 for existing loans.</p>
<p>&quot;As expected, the recent increase in wholesale money market rates has caught up with us,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
<p>e-mail wellington.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
